    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-26",
      "edition": "Thursday 26 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Scrum battle",
          "heading": "Thomas Domingo says France can crack the Springbok scrum at Twickenham",
          "body": "Former France loosehead Thomas Domingo, capped 36 times and now advising referees on scrum matters, insists the South Africans are as beatable as anyone ahead of Sunday's final. His answer to their heavy, dense pack is speed at the hit: concede the minimum centimetres before they settle, because once they start going forward, holding them burns energy. He judged the Bok tightheads close to pushing across while staying legal, and called the hooker's footwork crucial. France conceded nine scrum penalties against the Boks in Paris."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Australia's Allan Alaalatoa named co-captain for 100th Test",
          "body": "Ireland recall Jacob Stockdale on left wing for Australia. England recall Freddie Steward for All Blacks rematch. Fiji name Isoa Nasilasila captain for Italy rematch."
        }
      ],
      "match": {
        "venue": "Allianz Stadium, Twickenham",
        "referee": "Karl Dickson"
      },
      "source": {
        "name": "Rugbyrama"
      }
    },
    "388": {
      "date": "2026-11-26",
      "edition": "Thursday 26 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Wing recall",
          "heading": "Jacob Stockdale recalled on Ireland's left wing for Australia, replacing Mack Hansen",
          "body": "Ulster form has earned the 30-year-old a 44th cap: three tries in as many games for the province this season. He sat out the wins over Argentina, Fiji and South Africa, and the fifth-place final against the Wallabies will be his first Test since July's Nations Championship victory over Japan. Hansen is not in the matchday 23. Stockdale is one of eight Ulster players in Andy Farrell's squad, with Robert Baloucoune retained on the right after his two tries against the Springboks."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Australia's Allan Alaalatoa named co-captain for 100th Test",
          "body": "England recall Freddie Steward for All Blacks rematch. Fiji name Isoa Nasilasila captain for Italy rematch."
