          "kicker": "Pundit's pick",
          "heading": "BBC's Tom English urges Scotland to let Liam McConnell loose against Argentina",
          "body": "Liam McConnell's hat-trick in the 67-5 rout of Japan has BBC Scotland's chief sports writer Tom English wanting more of him in the seventh-place final against the Pumas. English called him \"fantastically promising\" but was less taken with the team's discipline. Scotland gave up seven penalties in the first half against Japan, and he argues Gregor Townsend must privately be cursing a habit that cost them heavily against New Zealand only a few weeks ago."
        },
